      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Brown‑Lanier House, a 175‑year‑old building, served as a home, headquarters, and hospital during the Civil War’s 1862 Battle of Mill Springs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
